{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>大稻埕永樂市場內的「丸隆生魚行」深受台灣人歡迎，下午1點門外已排長龍，但翻檯快，只需等待10分鐘便可入座。店內主打厚切魚生及壽司，就算柯打多款海鮮，人均消費亦只需港幣$200左右，每人低消達港幣$80還可以任添滿載魚肉及豆腐的味噌湯，性價比極高！\n</p>\n<p>必點雜錦刺身，魚生的長度拍得住一部iPhone；海膽壽司同樣足料，海膽堆成山一樣高，鮮甜綿密，帆立貝與紅蝦亦夠新鮮。</p>\n<p>丸隆生魚行<br/>\n📍地址：台北大稻埕永樂市場1418攤位</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501043245258093_18100151876afdaf821b9d5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501043245258093_18100151876afdaf821b9d5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@ayooo_production)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df4XExrTMRg/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">台北美食</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a7%e7%a8%bb%e5%9f%95/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大稻埕</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b0%b8%e6%a8%82%e5%b8%82%e5%a0%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">永樂市場</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@ayooo_production資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df4XExrTMRg/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:39.773957+00:00","quality":